# Egress allow-list (extended regex, host-matched). FilterDefaultDeny=Yes, so
# ONLY hosts matching a line here are reachable; everything else is refused.
# The agent reaches the Anthropic API and nothing else on the internet
# (portitor is on the internal network, not via this proxy).
#
# This is the image's baked DEFAULT (a bare `docker run` of the base
# egress-proxy:<hash> image uses it). Per-instance stacks REPLACE it wholesale: faber-stack bakes an image
# (egress-proxy-<instance>) carrying $CONFIG_DIR/egress-filter at this path, generated from
# stack.json's allow list, one anchored `^host$` line each. Keep this default minimal.
^api\.anthropic\.com$
